[sub_resource type="RectangleShape2D" id="RectangleShape2D_kill"]
size = Vector2(8000, 40)

; A molten core in the middle of an unbroken floor, behind shield walls you
; can smash (issue #143: #18's Hazard, #53's BreakableWall and #18's
; MovingPlatform). Bulwark's walls guard a keep. These guard a pit of death.
;
; **Floor.** One slab, x=-720..720, top y=320. There is no gap in it. The
; ring-outs are the open ends and the core.
;
; **Core.** Two Hazards side by side on the floor (x=-160..160, y=272..320).
; Touching it eliminates at any health, like the kill zone.
;
; **Shields.** A BreakableWall stands on each side of the core (x=+-174..+-206,
; y=160..320). While both stand, nobody can be knocked into the core, so the
; round opens as two separate halves. Swinging at your own side's shield wears
; it down. Once it breaks, the core is open to anyone thrown along the floor
; from that side.
;
; **Bridge.** A MovingPlatform (180 wide, top y=90) runs over both walls from
; x=-320 to 320 and back in 3.5 s each way. The walls' tops are 50 px below
; its underside. The bridge is the only way to cross while the walls stand,
; and it passes over the pickup above the core (0, 50).

; **Hill (issue #416).** King of the Hill's hill sits on the floor out on a
; wing (HillSpot0: x=-420; HillSpot1: x=420), a full hill radius clear of the
; core and its shields, so it is safe to hold.

; Backdrop (issue #117): magenta haze over a skyline of stacks.
